  "proved_scope": [
    "For every countable purely infinite simple ring R and n >= 1, the MF-hom kernel of GL_n(R) equals its commutator subgroup, and the quotient is a countable abelian MF group.",
    "For n >= 2, that commutator subgroup is EL_n(R), intrinsically has full MF radical, and every MF-target homomorphism factors uniquely through abelianization.",
    "Every unit is congruent modulo cornerUnitSubgroup to a unit fixing a nonzero idempotent; no commutator assumption is needed for this reduction.",
    "The supported-unit and arbitrary-unit AGP interfaces are proved rather than assumed."
  ],
